sentences.text:
"7. In the result, I pass the following order:
ORDER i) Writ petition is disposed off;
Sri Chandrashekar Nooyi vs The Special Land Acquisition Officer on 11 July, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/196325312/
2 NC: 2023:KHC:23931 ii) The dispute involved in the present petition with regard to quantum of compensation payable to the petitioners as well as the legality, validity and correctness of the impugned awards are hereby referred to the Deputy Commissioner/ Statutory Arbitrator before whom, the petitions filed by the respondents challenging the first / original awards passed by the respondents which were subject matter of Valerial Sequeria's case (supra) are pending adjudication for disposal in accordance with law.
iii) The Deputy Commissioner/ Statutory Arbitrator before whom the aforesaid petitions filed by the respondents are pending, is hereby directed to club / tag the dispute involved in the present writ petition also along with NC: 2023:KHC:23931 pending petitions and dispose of the same together in accordance with law;
iv) Liberty is reserved in favour of the petitioners herein to file pleadings, documents, etc. in the matters referred to the Deputy Commissioner/ Statutory Arbitrator pursuant to this order;
v) All rival contentions are kept open and no opinion is expressed on the same;
vi) The Deputy Commissioner/ Statutory Arbitrator is directed to dispose of all the proceedings including the proceedings referred to under this order, within a period of six months from the date of receipt of a copy of this order;
vii) It is made clear that this order is restricted to the petitioners only and is made in NC:
2023:KHC:23931 the peculiar/ special facts and circumstances of the instant case and shall not be treated as a precedent nor having any precedential value for any purpose whatsoever."

